erived SI unit joule divided by the SI base unit second.", "source": "UNECE_REC20", "source_version": "GitHub datasets/unece-units-of-measure (Redistributed)"}, {"canonical_code": "UNECE_REC20_P15", "standard_code": "P15", "name": "joule per minute", "symbol": "J/min", "category": "1M", "source_status": "", "status": "ACTIVE", "description": "Quotient from the derived SI unit joule divided by the unit minute.", "source": "UNECE_REC20", "source_version": "GitHub datasets/unece-units-of-measure (Redistributed)"}, {"canonical_code": "UNECE_REC20_P16", "standard_code": "P16", "name": "joule per hour", "symbol": "J/h", "category": "1M", "source_status": "", "status": "ACTIVE", "description": "Quotient from the derived SI unit joule divided by the unit hour.", "source": "UNECE_REC20", "source_version": "GitHub datasets/unece-units-of-measure (Redistributed)"}, {"canonical_code": "UNECE_REC20_P17", "standard_code": "P17", "name": "joule per day", "symbol": "J/d", "category": "1M", "source_status": "", "status": "ACTIVE", "description": "Quotient from the derived SI unit joule divided by the unit day.", "source": "UNECE_REC20", "source_version": "GitHub datasets/unece-units-of-measure (Redistributed)"}, {"canonical_code": "UNECE_REC20_P18", "standard_code": "P18", "name": "kilojoule per second", "symbol": "kJ/s", "category": "1M", "source_status": "", "status": "ACTIVE", "description": "Quotient from the 1000-fold of the derived SI unit joule divided by the SI base unit second.", "source": "UNECE_REC20", "source_version": "GitHub datasets/unece-units-of-measure (Redistributed)"}, {"canonical_code": "UNECE_REC20_P19", "standard_code": "P19", "name": "kilojoule per minute", "symbol": "kJ/min", "category": "1M", "source_status": "", "status": "ACTIVE", "description": "Quotient from the 1000-fold of the derived SI unit joule divided by the unit minute.", "source": "UNECE_REC20", "source_version": "GitHub datasets/unece-units-of-measure (Redistributed)"}, {"canonical_code": "UNE